om/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105475","id":2817133415,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6n6gtn","user":{"login":"ze2j","id":46556066,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ2NTU2MDY2","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/46556066?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j","html_url":"https://github.com/ze2j","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ze2j/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-20T11:49:59Z","updated_at":"2025-04-20T11:49:59Z","body":"It seems to me that `res://all_resources.zip` is not correct. It should be a file system path something like `c:/all_resources.zip` on Windows.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2817133415/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2824207288","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/105475#issuecomment-2824207288","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/105475","id":2824207288,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6oVfu4","user":{"login":"Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou","html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-23T12:54:42Z","updated_at":"2025-04-23T12:56:14Z","body":"Indeed, export paths on the CLI can either be absolute system paths, or relative to the project root. If you specify just `all_resources.zip`, it'll write `all_resources.zip` at the project root (no need to specify `res://`).\n\nWe should either print an error when trying to export to a `res://` path (it likely indicates a mistake somewhere), or just trim it as it's the same as writing a relative path in this context.\n\nHandling `res://` paths as project-relative paths could be useful in case we decide to change export behavior in Godot 5, as per https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/issues/4951.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2824207288/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]